BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Community Rock Painting
DTSTART:20260917T180000Z
DTEND:20260917T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260904T041538Z
UID:bfchamber-community-rock-painting-2026-09-17-0100@linn-county-scraper.
 local
DESCRIPTION:💜 Paint a rock. Share a message. Spread a little hope.In re
 cognition of Suicide Prevention Month\, Pershing Health System’s Senior 
 Life Solutions team invites you to join us for a special Community Rock Pa
 inting event on Thursday\, September 17.Sometimes a few simple words can m
 ake a difference. Come paint positive and encouraging messages on rocks th
 at can help remind someone that they matter\, they are not alone and there
  is always hope.This is a FREE\, family-friendly event\, and all ages are 
 welcome. All painting materials will be provided\, so all you need to brin
 g is yourself and a little creativity!While you’re here\, you’ll also 
 have an opportunity to learn more about suicide prevention\, mental health
  awareness and resources available in our community.📅 Thursday\, Septem
 ber 17\, 2026⏰ 1:00–3:00 p.m.📍 Pershing Health System Dining Room
 🎨 FREE | All ages welcome | Materials providedBring a friend\, bring yo
 ur family or simply stop by. Together\, we can help break the silence\, su
 pport one another and spread kindness throughout our community. 💜🩵
LOCATION:Brookfield\, MO
X-EVENT-TYPE:Other
END:VEVENT
